                <pb facs="0424" n="326" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg326"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President to the German Emperor</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-07-05"><hi rendition="#italic">July 5,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">His Imperial and Royal Majesty <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >William II</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Berlin:</hi></p>
                <p>The confirmation of the murder of Your Majesty’s minister in Pekin leads me to
                    tender to Your Majesty and to the family of Baron von Ketteler my sorrowful
                    condolences and those of the American people.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. McKinley.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
